<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Developer Zone Premier Account Approved</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<style type ="text/css"> 
	
	
	/* IE8 COMPENSATE FOR HTML5 COMPATIBILITY */
	article, aside, figure, caption, figcaption, footer, header, main, nav, section, summary {
	display: block;
	}

	
	/* STRUCTURE */
	body {
	-webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
	background-color:#f9f9f9;
	background: url('https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png') repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;
	height: 100%;      
	outline: medium none;
	}
	
	#container { /* "Container" contains all the layout code, sets page width in (pixels), and easily centers page. */
	width: 600px;  /* Good width of the vast majority of computer screens - 960px is standard because most users have 1024×768 resolution or higher */
	margin-top: 10px; /* Outside the container line */ 
	margin-right: auto; /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */
	margin-bottom: 10px;
	margin-left: auto;  /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */
	position: relative;  /* "relative" because using things called floats */  /* position options {"relative", "absolute"} */
	background-color: #FFFFFF;
	border-color: #E5E5E5;
	border-style: solid;
	padding: 25px 50px 0px 50px; /*top right bottom left  -- Inside the container line */ 
	border-width: 1px;
	overflow: hidden;   
	line-height: 1.5em;
	}
	
	
	hr {
	background-color: #E5E5E5;
	color:#E5E5E5;
	border: 0 none;
	height: 1px;
	}	


	img.floating {  /* image with text around it */ 
	float: right;
	padding: 4px 0px 0px 50px;  /** top right bottom left **/ 
	}


	/* TEXT STYLES */
	body {
	font-family: "Intel Clear", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; 
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: 10pt;
	color: #666666;
	}
	
	header {
	font-family: "Intel Clear Pro", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: 1.1em;
	color: #003C71;
	line-height: 2em;
	}
	
	section  {
	font-size: 0.8em;	
	font-style: italic;
	color: black;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	
	footer  {
	font-size: 0.9em;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	
	footer a {
	text-decoration: none;
	}
	
	a {
	color: #086DB6;
	}
	
	.intelBlueTextStyle {
	color: #086DB6;
	}
	
	.subjectTextStyle {
	font-size: 1.2em;
	font-weight: bold;
	color: #086DB6;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	</style>
</head>


<body>
<div id="container"><header>
<h1><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/5104bda0-0fc2-11ec-901e-3750230d5760.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" width="700" height="156" /></h1>
<hr /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><!-- horizontal line --></span></header><main>
<p class="subjectTextStyle"><span face="intel clear, sans-serif" style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Welcome to Developer Zone Premier</span></p>
<p><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Welcome {!Contact.Name},</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">You have been registered for a Developer Zone Premier Account.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Your request for a Developer Zone Premier Account has been approved. Use this <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/design/confidential/restricted-documents.html">link</a> to sign into Intel's Developer Zone.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Access to Developer Zone Premier has been provisioned to this account:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"> <b>Email Address:</b> <span class="intelBlueTextStyle">{!Contact.Email}</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Please retain this email for future reference.</span></p>
</main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Your password should be protected as confidential. Your use of the password and Intel's websites are governed by Intel's Terms of Use linked from the bottom of each respective site's web pages.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">If you have any questions, please <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/forms/support/my-intel-sign-on-support.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">contact us</a>.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">To manage your profile, including available marketing subscriptions, please visit <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/my-intel/profile.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">My Intel</a>.</span></p>
<main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response. To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, add us to your address book.</span></p>
</main>
<section>
<p style="text-align: right;"></p>
</section>
<hr /><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><img class="floating" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png" alt="Intel logo" height="42" width="64" /> Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more Information, please see the <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html">Intel Privacy Notice</a>. <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html">Intel Cookie Notice</a>. </span><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"> <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/terms-of-use.html">Legal Information</a> | <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/trademarks.html">Trademarks</a> | <span style="font-size: 1em;"> © </span> Intel Corporation.</span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer></div>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></p>
</body>
</html>